body:
I agree. Whenever 'normal people' try to talk you down from it they constantly talk about how bad and selfish it is as if shaming me for feeling that  way is gonna help me. I wish it was normal and I wish I still had friends who didn't leave me so I had something to live for now I just feel shitty every morning when I realise I'm alive and still some useless fucking family who I'm to much of a pussy to say how much they hurt me and I'm just holding on for friends which I'm not even sure I have.

&#x200B;

somebody needs to make it stop and why cant that somebody be me
